# The craft rulings (2023-11-10): "If a card that isn't a transforming double-faced card becomes a copy of a card with
# craft, it'll stay in exile if you activate the craft ability." Phyrexian Metamorph enters as a copy of Dire Flail and
# so has its craft ability. Activated, it exiles the Metamorph and an Ornithopter; as the ability resolves the Metamorph
# card, a copy no longer, is not a double-faced card, so it stays in exile (CR 712.14a). The real Dire Flail is
# untouched.

